  "description": "Wired M-Bus (EN 13757-2/-3) for IoTCom.Net: frame codec (E5, short, control, long), variable data structure with DIF/DIFE/VIF/VIFE records, BCD and type F/G dates, a master (ping, REQ_UD2 with FCB, primary scan, secondary-address selection) and a slave simulator with heat, water and electricity meters. The codec is mirrored by a fuzzed Rust crate through shared conformance vectors. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
